	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg10481"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=707" title="View the profile of Corolinth">Corolinth</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 44<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/gohper.jpg" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=707"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg10481#msg10481"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg10481#msg10481">Re: And yet again a Top Ten guilds List</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #1361 on:</b> August 26, 2004, 12:59:09 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div class="quoteheader"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg10470#msg10470">Quote from: Kinladar on August 26, 2004, 08:59:48 am</a></div><div class="quote">I think I like Ikkinz 4 raid, Antechamber though, more than any of the others, at least when you down the big mofo, you get 4 really nice things at a minimum. And if you watch what you&#039;re doing, (with a dash of Luck) it&#039;s only a 2 hour raid max. I doubt we&#039;ll put Uqua on farm status though.... that&#039;s a real pain.</div><br />Uqua really isn&#039;t so bad in hindsight. After our last run for reflagging when we fucked up and managed to get 8-9 mobs in camp at once, I really don&#039;t hate Uqua. It was like our Fairy Godmother showed up and waved around the Wand of Pwn. Then suddenly, Uqua didn&#039;t suck anymore.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />&lt;Echoes in Eternity&gt;
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
