							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg10492#msg10492"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg10492#msg10492">Re: And yet again a Top Ten guilds List</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #1362 on:</b> August 26, 2004, 02:34:55 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							We&#039;ve not been really hammering that hard at it either though. Been farming and gearing up the tanks etc.... But we&#039;re ready to finish it off soon I think.<br /><br />I think we&#039;ve only really hammered at Uqua like 5-6 times total.<br /><br />
						</td>
